      "title": "CONCOR: New Shipping JV And Vizhinjam MoU Will Test Elevated P/E",
      "body": "Analysts have reduced their price target on Container Corporation of India by ₹0 to ₹457, citing slightly higher discount rates, modest adjustments to revenue growth and profit margin expectations, and a revised future P/E assumption. What's in the News Container Corporation of India signed a non binding, non exclusive MoU with Vizhinjam International Seaport Ltd on 23 February 2026 to develop a Container Freight Station near Vizhinjam International Seaports in Kerala, with VISL providing land on mutually agreed terms (company announcement).",
